 src=\"images/image-26d90033-ca8f-48ad-85f2-577fc09631b9.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 986px;; aspect-ratio: 1681 / 986; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h1 dir=\"auto\">TODO: Hire Image Processing Implementation</h1>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Source</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">PRD: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-hire-image-processing/prd.md</code><br>\nBrief: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/PRD/2026-08-26-hire-image-processing/brief.md</code><br>\nBranch: <code class=\"notranslate\">product-docs</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">UI/UX Designer TODO</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add <strong>Hire Image Processing</strong> to desktop and mobile navigation designs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design <code class=\"notranslate\">/hire-image-processing</code> directory page using the existing 360 Photographer Directory visual language.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design a <strong>Top Image Processing Users</strong> section similar to <strong>Top-rated 360 photographers</strong>, scoped to image processings only.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design image processing card states with: name, avatar, location, timezone, parsed languages, software equipment, services, rating/reviews, and profile link.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design search input for editor name, location, parsed language, software equipment, service, and profile text.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design timezone filter using backend-provided timezone values.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design software filter using equipment type <code class=\"notranslate\">5</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">Software</code> values.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design default, loading, empty, filtered-empty, and error states for the editor directory.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design <code class=\"notranslate\">/image-processing/[slug]</code> editor detail page based on photographer detail layout.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Include editor detail sections: profile summary, role label, location, timezone, parsed languages, software equipment, services, about, portfolio/work samples, reviews, and contact CTA.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design empty states for missing editor portfolio and missing reviews.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Design photographer detail metadata addition for timezone and parsed language display.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Write UI copy for editor-specific labels, contact CTA, success/error messages, empty states, and filter labels.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Verify mobile layouts for nav, filters, cards, top list, profile detail, portfolio, reviews, and contact form.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Provide final handoff notes for spacing, responsive behavior, card density, filter behavior, and reused components.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Front End Developer TODO</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add <strong>Hire Image Processing</strong> to <code class=\"notranslate\">SiteHeader</code> desktop and mobile navigation.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Create route <code class=\"notranslate\">/hire-image-processing</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Create route <code class=\"notranslate\">/image-processing/[slug]</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Extend frontend types/DTOs for backend fields: <code class=\"notranslate\">role</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">timezone</code>, CSV <code class=\"notranslate\">language</code>, role-compatible <code class=\"notranslate\">services</code>, and software equipment type <code class=\"notranslate\">5</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Parse backend CSV <code class=\"notranslate\">language</code> into display/search values without changing backend shape.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Treat image processing as records with <code class=\"notranslate\">role=image_processing</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Keep capture photographers scoped to <code class=\"notranslate\">role=photographer_360</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Implement editor directory data loading from available public API fields.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Build editor directory grid/list.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Build <strong>Top Image Processing Users</strong> using existing public API ranking/sort data unless a top editor API already exists.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Implement client-side matching where needed for parsed language, software equipment, services, and profile text.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Implement timezone filter using backend timezone/catalog values.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Implement software filter using equipment type <code class=\"notranslate\">5</code> / <code class=\"notranslate\">Software</code> values when available.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add loading, empty, filtered-empty, and error states.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Build reusable editor card component or adapt existing photographer card pattern.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Build editor detail page using photographer detail patterns.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Reuse existing contact form pattern with image-editor-specific labels and success text.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add timezone and parsed language display to photographer detail pages.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add SEO metadata and canonical URL for <code class=\"notranslate\">/hire-image-processing</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add SEO metadata and canonical URL for <code class=\"notranslate\">/image-processing/[slug]</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add sitemap entry for <code class=\"notranslate\">/hire-image-processing</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add sitemap entries for eligible <code class=\"notranslate\">/image-processing/[slug]</code> records.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Verify existing photographer directory, map search, photographer detail, contact, portfolio, and review flows are unchanged.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Test desktop and mobile layouts for no overflow.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Test missing data cases: no timezone, no language, no software equipment, no portfolio, no reviews, API error.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Document any backend follow-up needed if public list data does not expose software equipment or enough fields for search/filter/top list.</li>\n</ul>",
